# Every on<event>="..." in every language's templates must reach a handler.
#
# A menu item whose command was renamed, or mistyped, logs "Unknown command" and
# does nothing — and no scenario presses most of the menu. This reads the
# templates instead, all five languages in one run, and asks the same lookup a
# click would. Commented-out markup is skipped.

check_menu_wiring
expect log_badge none
